{"key":"dsu-rollback-b20a82148bc5a5c0","sourceHash":"b20a82148bc5a5c0f5cf2c0632ba3b5fbe787fcbc784607fd05fac7a554f1a34","pattern":"dsu-rollback","category":"advanced-structures","title":"Challenge: Rollback DSU","idea":"Record every parent or size mutation so recursion over time can undo unions without path compression.","complexity":"O(log n) union/find typical · O(changes) history","source":"struct RollbackDsu {\n    parent: Vec<usize>,\n    size: Vec<usize>,\n    history: Vec<(usize, usize, usize)>,\n}\nimpl RollbackDsu {\n    fn new(n: usize) -> Self {\n        Self {\n            parent: (0..n).collect(),\n            size: vec![1; n],\n            history: Vec::new(),\n        }\n    }\n    fn root(&self, mut v: usize) -> usize {\n        while v != self.parent[v] {\n            v = self.parent[v];\n        }\n        v\n    }\n    fn join(&mut self, a: usize, b: usize) {\n        let (mut a, mut b) = (self.root(a), self.root(b));\n        if a == b {\n            return;\n        }\n        if self.size[a] < self.size[b] {\n            std::mem::swap(&mut a, &mut b);\n        }\n        self.history.push((b, a, self.size[a]));\n        self.parent[b] = a;\n        self.size[a] += self.size[b];\n    }\n    fn checkpoint(&self) -> usize {\n        self.history.len()\n    }\n    fn rollback(&mut self, mark: usize) {\n        while self.history.len() > mark {\n            let (b, a, size) = self.history.pop().unwrap();\n            self.parent[b] = b;\n            self.size[a] = size;\n        }\n    }\n}\nfn rollback_query(\n    n: usize,\n    before: &[(usize, usize)],\n    after: &[(usize, usize)],\n    query: (usize, usize),\n) -> bool {\n    let mut dsu = RollbackDsu::new(n);\n    for &(a, b) in before {\n        dsu.join(a, b);\n    }\n    let mark = dsu.checkpoint();\n    for &(a, b) in after {\n        dsu.join(a, b);\n    }\n    dsu.rollback(mark);\n    dsu.root(query.0) == dsu.root(query.1)\n}\n\nfn main() {\n    let result = rollback_query(3, &[(0, 1)], &[(1, 2)], (0, 1)).to_string();\n    println!(\"{result}\");\n}\n","sites":[{"line":8,"function":"new","statement":"Self {"},{"line":15,"function":"root","statement":"while v != self.parent[v] {"},{"line":16,"function":"root","statement":"v = self.parent[v];"},{"line":17,"function":"root","statement":"}"},{"line":18,"function":"root","statement":"v"},{"line":21,"function":"join","statement":"let (mut a, mut b) = (self.root(a), self.root(b));"},{"line":22,"function":"join","statement":"if a == b {"},{"line":23,"function":"join","statement":"return;"},{"line":25,"function":"join","statement":"if self.size[a] < self.size[b] {"},{"line":26,"function":"join","statement":"std::mem::swap(&mut a, &mut b);"},{"line":27,"function":"join","statement":"}"},{"line":28,"function":"join","statement":"self.history.push((b, a, self.size[a]));"},{"line":29,"function":"join","statement":"self.parent[b] = a;"},{"line":30,"function":"join","statement":"self.size[a] += self.size[b];"},{"line":31,"function":"join","statement":"}"},{"line":33,"function":"checkpoint","statement":"self.history.len()"},{"line":36,"function":"rollback","statement":"while self.history.len() > mark {"},{"line":37,"function":"rollback","statement":"let (b, a, size) = self.history.pop().unwrap();"},{"line":38,"function":"rollback","statement":"self.parent[b] = b;"},{"line":39,"function":"rollback","statement":"self.size[a] = size;"},{"line":40,"function":"rollback","statement":"}"},{"line":49,"function":"rollback_query","statement":"let mut dsu = RollbackDsu::new(n);"},{"line":50,"function":"rollback_query","statement":"for &(a, b) in before {"},{"line":51,"function":"rollback_query","statement":"dsu.join(a, b);"},{"line":52,"function":"rollback_query","statement":"}"},{"line":53,"function":"rollback_query","statement":"let mark = dsu.checkpoint();"},{"line":54,"function":"rollback_query","statement":"for &(a, b) in after {"},{"line":55,"function":"rollback_query","statement":"dsu.join(a, b);"},{"line":56,"function":"rollback_query","statement":"}"},{"line":57,"function":"rollback_query","statement":"dsu.rollback(mark);"},{"line":58,"function":"rollback_query","statement":"dsu.root(query.0) == dsu.root(query.1)"},{"line":62,"function":"main","statement":"let result = rollback_query(3, &[(0, 1)], &[(1, 2)], (0, 1)).to_string();"},{"line":63,"function":"main","statement":"println!(\"{result}\");"},{"line":64,"function":"main","statement":"}"}],"version":1,"input":"n=3 unions=(0,1) checkpoint union=(1,2) rollback query=(0,1)","stdout":"true\n","values":[{"type":"usize","data":{"kind":"scalar","text":"3"}},{"type":"&[(usize, usize)]","data":{"kind":"list","items":[{"kind":"list","items":[{"kind":"scalar","text":"0"},{"kind":"scalar","text":"1"}],"tuple":true}],"tuple":false}},{"type":"&[(usize, usize)]","data":{"kind":"list","items":[{"kind":"list","items":[{"kind":"scalar","text":"1"},{"kind":"scalar","text":"2"}],"tuple":true}],"tuple":false}},{"type":"(usize, usize)","data":{"kind":"list","items":[{"kind":"scalar","text":"0"},{"kind":"scalar","text":"1"}],"tuple":true}},{"type":"traced::RollbackDsu","data":{"kind":"named","name":"RollbackDsu","value":{"kind":"map","entries":[[{"kind":"scalar","text":"history"},{"kind":"list","items":[],"tuple":false}],[{"kind":"scalar","text":"parent"},{"kind":"list","items":[{"kind":"scalar","text":"0"},{"kind":"scalar","text":"1"},{"kind":"scalar","text":"2"}],"tuple":false}],[{"kind":"scalar","text":"size"},{"kind":"list","items":[{"kind":"scalar","text":"1"},{"kind":"scalar","text":"1"},{"kind":"scalar","text":"1"}],"tuple":false}]]}}},{"type":"usize","data":{"kind":"scalar","text":"0"}},{"type":"usize","data":{"kind":"scalar","text":"1"}},{"type":"traced::RollbackDsu","data":{"kind":"named","name":"RollbackDsu","value":{"kind":"map","entries":[[{"kind":"scalar","text":"history"},{"kind":"list","items":[{"kind":"list","items":[{"kind":"scalar","text":"1"},{"kind":"scalar","text":"0"},{"kind":"scalar","text":"1"}],"tuple":true}],"tuple":f